This workspace is Dad's garage review pack, not a software application to build.

Read and follow the pack-root `AGENTS.md`. Use `LLM-PROJECT-CONTEXT.md` for the current design, file map and limitations.

When asked to start or run the pack, follow `SETUP-BLENDER.md`: detect/reuse a compatible Blender, install the free official release if needed under the user's request and normal permissions, open `output/V4/model/garage-V4-review.blend` in the GUI, and open `START-HERE.html` in a browser. Do not rebuild the existing assets as part of startup.

The current V4 review model has provisional roof/plinth/frame dimensions. P02 drawings and V3 options are historical. Explain these distinctions when answering questions and preserve the supplied files.
